	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Dum in defensione communis doctrinę occupor et strenue laboro, q<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>uam iniquam mercedem rependant vicini, quia prę moerore nequeo, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>hic amicus noster tibi narrabit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et boni fratres nostri, qui pro <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>suggestu quotidie de sanctorum communicatione disserunt, tant<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>o <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>discrimine non moventur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Si nulla urbis huius cura eos tangit, ecclesiam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>pessumdari quomodo ex sua quiete spectant?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Non loquar hyperbolice.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Nisi mature succurritur, scito nostris exulibus civium omnium fortunas <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>esse in prędam datas, et omnes in custodiam coniectos ne quis egredi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>audeat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hęc indignitas, quamvis hominum silentio tegatur, lapides ipsos <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>concutere debet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Spero tamen, simul ac exposita res fuerit, tempestivum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>fore remedium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Apud vestros quidem neque fides tua, scio, neque sedulitas <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>deerit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quam vero dextre me gesserim contra <placeName>Saxones</placeName>, vos iudicabitis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Librum enim malui nondum absolutum mittere, quam vos tenere expectatione <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>suspensos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quum sciam me accersere omnium odia, erit mihi hoc non <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mediocris solatii loco, si vobis officium meum saltem placuerit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Certe <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quia deo gratum esse confido, intrepide et alacriter beluarum istarum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>rabiem in me provocare non dabitavi.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">In <persName ref="p8033">Bezę</persName> confessione, quia <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nihil subest periculi, facile excuso quod in fratrum gratiam moderatio<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ne adhibita studuerit placare feros homines: pręsertim quia distincte <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>prius explicuerat omnes suos sensus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ut vos in reditu cęlaret, factum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>esse mera incogitantia certo tibi persuade.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Neque enim scivissem <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nisi et huc usque virus suum sparsisset Valerandus, cuius ambitio vel <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>temeritas Francfordię coegit Gallos et Anglos hospites <placeName ref="l18">Augustanę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>confessioni subscribere, exceptione tamen interposita de voce sub<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>stantialiter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Decretum fuit ne posthac Germanici concionatores <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>illis molesti sint, donec conveniant ex utraque parte pręcipui.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Utinam non impedierit vestrorum hominum morositas quod nobis <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>summopere optandum fuit, qua vero de causa repudiatum fuerit <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nescio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, ornatissime vir et observande frater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8111">Petrum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Martyrem</persName> plurimum salvere cupio, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> et reliquos <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>collegas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Amici omnes te reverenter salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Genevę 7. idus <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>augusti 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">D. <lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8111">Martyri</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName>Comes Martinengus</persName> adhuc decumbit, sed absque periculo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Desperavimus de vita quatuor vel quinque integros dies.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Nunc sola ex morbo debilitas hominem in lecto retinet<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Or<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>n<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>atissimo viro et <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>fido ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>pastori <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>fratri et symmystę observando<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
